{%- comment -%}
  Duo bundle product page — 1 Deodorant Enhancer (customer picks the scent)
  + 1 fixed companion product (Cotton Dry Wipes).

  Adapted from sections/product-bundle.liquid. It is a separate section rather
  than a shared one because {% stylesheet %} / {% javascript %} blocks are
  concatenated theme-wide, so the two pages must not share a class prefix or a
  JS root selector — everything here is `bundle-duo` / `data-duo-*`.

  Only the scent is chosen, so only the scent is submitted as an option-group
  property. The companion is a fixed component of the bundle in Simple Bundles
  & Kits, which expands both into separate line items server-side (see
  addToCart below).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant | default: product.variants.first
  assign product_text_color = product.metafields.custom.product_text_color | default: '#3E2027'
  assign popup_text_color = section.settings.popup_text_color | default: '#3E2027'
  comment
    Gradient resolves metafield first, then the section setting. The scent pages
    (sections/product.liquid) have always been metafield-driven, so colors get
    authored on the product; this page only read its section setting, and a
    template with the setting saved meant no metafield could ever show through.
  endcomment
  assign gradient_1 = product.metafields.custom.gradient_color_1 | default: section.settings.gradient_color_1 | default: '#F4D2A4'
  assign gradient_2 = product.metafields.custom.gradient_color_2 | default: section.settings.gradient_color_2 | default: '#FCF5DE'
  assign bottle_size = product.metafields.custom.bottle_size
  assign product_details = product.metafields.custom.product_details
  assign scent_notes = product.metafields.custom.scent_notes
  assign key_ingredients = product.metafields.custom.key_ingredients
  assign full_ingredient_list = product.metafields.custom.full_ingredient_list
  assign scent_collection = section.settings.scent_collection

  comment
    Default scent — for the BOTTLE ART ONLY. An empty slot reads fine on the
    three-bottle bundle, where the whole row starts empty, but next to the fixed
    wipe it looks broken, so slot 1 opens on this scent.

    It is deliberately not a pre-made selection. When it was one, the page could
    add a scent the customer never consciously chose, and any mismatch between
    that scent's title and its option in Simple Bundles broke the bundle
    silently: the Scents group went unresolved, the whole duo price landed on
    the wipe, and the enhancer came out as a loose full-price line — the
    customer paid for the duo and for the enhancer again (order #6835).
    Add to cart now stays disabled until the customer picks, so nothing is ever
    submitted on their behalf.

    Resolved against the same eligibility filter the picker uses, and falls back
    to the first eligible scent when the configured one is sold out or coming
    soon, so the slot is never empty.
  endcomment
  assign default_scent_handle = section.settings.default_scent_product.handle
  assign default_scent = ''
  assign first_eligible_scent = ''
  if scent_collection
    for scent_product in scent_collection.products
      assign scent_coming_soon = false
      if scent_product.tags contains 'coming-soon' or scent_product.tags contains 'Coming soon' or scent_product.tags contains 'coming soon' or scent_product.tags contains 'Coming Soon'
        assign scent_coming_soon = true
      endif
      if scent_product.metafields.custom.scent_name != blank and scent_product.available and scent_coming_soon == false
        if first_eligible_scent == blank
          assign first_eligible_scent = scent_product
        endif
        if scent_product.handle == default_scent_handle
          assign default_scent = scent_product
        endif
      endif
    endfor
  endif
  if default_scent == blank
    assign default_scent = first_eligible_scent
  endif
  assign default_scent_image = default_scent.metafields.custom.card_image | default: default_scent.featured_image

  comment
    The companion slot is fixed art, not a picker. Prefer an explicit image
    override, then the product's card image, then its featured image — matching
    how the scent bottles resolve in the bundle.
  endcomment
  assign companion_product = section.settings.companion_product
  assign companion_image = section.settings.companion_image | default: companion_product.metafields.custom.card_image | default: companion_product.featured_image
  assign companion_title = section.settings.companion_label | default: companion_product.title

  comment
    Simple Bundles matches each component by OPTION GROUP name, and the value
    must be the option name inside that group. Both must match the app exactly
    or the line will not expand into separate order lines.

    This bundle is built in the app's "Manually build" mode, which makes every
    component an option group — including the wipe. So the wipe is NOT a fixed
    component the app resolves on its own: it has to be submitted just like the
    scent, even though the customer never picks it (its group holds one option).
  endcomment
  assign scent_property_name = section.settings.scent_property_name | default: 'Scents'
  assign companion_property_name = section.settings.companion_property_name | default: 'Wipes'
  assign companion_property_value = section.settings.companion_property_value | default: companion_product.title

  comment
    Coming-soon state for the BUNDLE itself (the checks further down filter
    coming-soon scents out of the picker, which is a different thing). Matches
    the tag spellings product.liquid accepts. A bundle parent carries no
    inventory of its own, so there is no out-of-stock case to gate on here —
    availability comes from the components via Simple Bundles.
  endcomment
  assign is_coming_soon = false
  if product.tags contains 'coming-soon' or product.tags contains 'Coming soon' or product.tags contains 'coming soon' or product.tags contains 'Coming Soon'
    assign is_coming_soon = true
  endif

  comment
    Aggregate rating is synced from Klaviyo Reviews into the standard
    `reviews.rating` / `reviews.rating_count` Shopify metafields.
  endcomment
  assign rating = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value.rating | default: 0 | round: 1
  assign rating_scale = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value.scale_max | default: 5
  assign review_count = product.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value | default: 0
-%}

<section
  class="bundle-duo full-width"
  data-section-id="{{ section.id }}"
  aria-label="{{ product.title }}"
  style="--gradient-1: {{ gradient_1 }}; --gradient-2: {{ gradient_2 }}; --product-text: {{ product_text_color }}; --popup-text: {{ popup_text_color }};">

  {%- comment -%} Mobile Header {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="bundle-duo__mobile-header">
    <div class="bundle-duo__mobile-subtitle-row">
      <p class="bundle-duo__subtitle">{{ product.type | default: 'Deodorant Enhancer®' }}</p>
    </div>
    <h1 class="bundle-duo__title" data-duo-title>{{ product.title }}</h1>
    {% if bottle_size %}
      <p class="bundle-duo__size bundle-duo__size--mobile">{{ bottle_size }}{% if companion_title != blank %} + {{ companion_title }}{% endif %}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    Image Column — the picked bottle on the left, the fixed companion on the
    right. Slot 1 opens on the default scent so the pair never reads as broken
    before a pick; the JS swaps the same <img> on every pick after that. It is
    artwork only — it stands in for "a bottle goes here", and does NOT stand in
    for a choice. The dashed placeholder is only rendered as a safety net for
    when no scent is eligible at all (every one sold out or coming soon).
    Slot 2 is static and never changes.

    No srcset here on purpose — the JS swap only sets .src, and a srcset would
    win over it and freeze the bottle on the default scent.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="bundle-duo__image-column">
    <div class="bundle-duo__bottles" data-duo-bottles>
      <div class="bundle-duo__bottle-slot" data-duo-slot="1">
        {%- if default_scent_image -%}
          <img
            class="bundle-duo__bottle-img"
            src="{{ default_scent_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
            alt="{{ default_scent.title | escape }}"
            loading="eager"
            width="{{ default_scent_image.width }}"
            height="{{ default_scent_image.height }}">
        {%- else -%}
          <img
            class="bundle-duo__bottle-img"
            src=""
            alt=""
            loading="eager"
            style="display: none;">
          <div class="bundle-duo__bottle-placeholder">
            <span class="bundle-duo__bottle-number">1</span>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      <div class="bundle-duo__bottle-slot bundle-duo__bottle-slot--companion">
        {%- if companion_image -%}
          <img
            class="bundle-duo__companion-img"
            src="{{ companion_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
            srcset="{{ companion_image | image_url: width: 400 }} 400w, {{ companion_image | image_url: width: 800 }} 800w, {{ companion_image | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w"
            sizes="(min-width: 990px) 350px, 200px"
            alt="{{ companion_title | escape }}"
            loading="eager"
            width="800"
            height="800">
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="bundle-duo__bottle-placeholder">
            <span class="bundle-duo__bottle-number">2</span>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Info Column {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="bundle-duo__info-column">

    {%- comment -%} Desktop Header {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="bundle-duo__desktop-header">
      <p class="bundle-duo__subtitle">{{ product.type | default: 'Deodorant Enhancer®' }}</p>
      <h1 class="bundle-duo__title">{{ product.title }}</h1>
      {% if bottle_size %}
        <p class="bundle-duo__size-line">{{ bottle_size }}{% if companion_title != blank %} + {{ companion_title }}{% endif %}</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} Rating (synced from Klaviyo Reviews metafields) {%- endcomment -%}
    {% if review_count > 0 %}
      {% render 'star-rating',
        rating: rating,
        count: review_count,
        scale_max: rating_scale,
        class: 'bundle-duo__rating',
        scroll_to_reviews: true
      %}
    {% endif %}

    {%- comment -%}
      Scent Selector — one only. The `data-duo-scent-selector="1"` index is kept
      (rather than dropped) so the JS selection/rendering path stays identical to
      the bundle's, and so a second picked component could be added later without
      reworking it.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="bundle-duo__selectors" data-duo-selectors>
      <div class="bundle-duo__selector" data-duo-scent-selector="1">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="bundle-duo__selector-trigger"
          aria-expanded="false"
          aria-haspopup="listbox"
          aria-controls="duo-scent-list-{{ section.id }}">
          {%- comment -%}
            Reads as a prompt until the customer picks, and nothing is added to
            the cart before they do — the bottle beside it is a preview of the
            pair, not a selection. See the default-scent note at the top.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <span class="bundle-duo__selector-label" data-selector-label>{{ 'sections.product_bundle.choose_scent' | t }}</span>
          <svg class="bundle-duo__selector-chevron" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12" height="6" viewBox="0 0 12 6" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <path d="M1 0.5L6 5.5L11 0.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <ul
          class="bundle-duo__selector-list"
          id="duo-scent-list-{{ section.id }}"
          role="listbox"
          aria-label="{{ 'sections.product_bundle.choose_scent' | t }}">
          {% if scent_collection %}
            {% for scent_product in scent_collection.products %}
              {%- comment -%} Skip scents that are sold out or tagged coming soon so they can't be picked in the bundle. {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- assign scent_coming_soon = false -%}
              {%- if scent_product.tags contains 'coming-soon' or scent_product.tags contains 'Coming soon' or scent_product.tags contains 'coming soon' or scent_product.tags contains 'Coming Soon' -%}
                {%- assign scent_coming_soon = true -%}
              {%- endif -%}
              {% if scent_product.metafields.custom.scent_name != blank and scent_product.available and scent_coming_soon == false %}
                <li
                  role="option"
                  aria-selected="false"
                  class="bundle-duo__selector-option"
                  data-product-handle="{{ scent_product.handle }}"
                  data-product-title="{{ scent_product.title | escape }}"
                  data-variant-id="{{ scent_product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}"
                  data-variant-gid="{{ scent_product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id | prepend: 'gid://shopify/ProductVariant/' }}"
                  data-card-image="{% if scent_product.metafields.custom.card_image != blank %}{{ scent_product.metafields.custom.card_image | image_url: width: 800 }}{% elsif scent_product.featured_image %}{{ scent_product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}{% endif %}">
                  {{ scent_product.title }}
                </li>
              {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          {% endif %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} Divider {%- endcomment -%}
    <hr class="bundle-duo__divider">

    {%- comment -%} Price + Actions {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="bundle-duo__purchase-row">
      <p class="bundle-duo__price" data-duo-price>{{ current_variant.price | money }}</p>
      <div class="bundle-duo__actions">
        {%- if is_coming_soon -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            The JS null-guards [data-duo-add], so omitting the button here is
            safe — the picker still works, there is just nothing to add with.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {% render 'notify-me-form',
            variant: current_variant,
            button_class: 'bundle-duo__button bundle-duo__button--add'
          %}
        {%- else -%}
          <button
            type="button"
            class="bundle-duo__button bundle-duo__button--add"
            disabled
            data-duo-add>
            <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
              <path d="M0.75 7.75H14.75M7.75 0.75V14.75" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
            <span>{{ 'sections.product_bundle.add_to_cart' | t }}</span>
          </button>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} Accordions {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign show_watch_in_action = false
      if section.settings.show_watch_in_action
        if section.settings.videowise_embed != blank or request.design_mode
          assign show_watch_in_action = true
        endif
      endif
    -%}
    <div class="bundle-duo__accordions" data-duo-accordions>
      {%- comment -%} Top divider is skipped when the videos lead, so they sit flush {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- unless show_watch_in_action -%}
        <hr class="bundle-duo__divider">
      {%- endunless -%}

      {%- comment -%} Watch It In Action {%- endcomment -%}
      {% if show_watch_in_action %}
        <div class="bundle-duo__accordion is-open">
          <div
            class="bundle-duo__accordion-content"
            role="region"
            aria-label="{{ 'sections.product_bundle.watch_in_action' | t }}">
            <div class="bundle-duo__accordion-body">
              {%- if section.settings.videowise_embed != blank -%}
                <div class="bundle-duo__video-embed">
                  {{ section.settings.videowise_embed }}
                </div>
              {%- else -%}
                <div class="bundle-duo__video-grid">
                  <div class="bundle-duo__video-placeholder"></div>
                  <div class="bundle-duo__video-placeholder"></div>
                  <div class="bundle-duo__video-placeholder"></div>
                  <div class="bundle-duo__video-placeholder"></div>
                  <div class="bundle-duo__video-placeholder"></div>
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          </div>
          <hr class="bundle-duo__divider">
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if product_details %}
        <div class="bundle-duo__accordion" data-accordion>
          <button
            type="button"
            id="accordion-details-trigger-{{ section.id }}"
            class="bundle-duo__accordion-trigger"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="accordion-details-{{ section.id }}">
            <span>{{ 'sections.product_bundle.details' | t }}</span>
            <svg class="bundle-duo__accordion-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              <path d="M1 8H15M8 1V15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <div
            class="bundle-duo__accordion-content"
            id="accordion-details-{{ section.id }}"
            role="region"
            aria-labelledby="accordion-details-trigger-{{ section.id }}"
            aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="bundle-duo__accordion-body">
              {{ product.metafields.custom.product_details | metafield_tag }}
            </div>
          </div>
          <hr class="bundle-duo__divider">
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if scent_notes %}
        <div class="bundle-duo__accordion" data-accordion>
          <button
            type="button"
            id="accordion-scent-trigger-{{ section.id }}"
            class="bundle-duo__accordion-trigger"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="accordion-scent-{{ section.id }}">
            <span>{{ 'sections.product_bundle.scent_notes' | t }}</span>
            <svg class="bundle-duo__accordion-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              <path d="M1 8H15M8 1V15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <div
            class="bundle-duo__accordion-content"
            id="accordion-scent-{{ section.id }}"
            role="region"
            aria-labelledby="accordion-scent-trigger-{{ section.id }}"
            aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="bundle-duo__accordion-body">
              {{ product.metafields.custom.scent_notes | metafield_tag }}
            </div>
          </div>
          <hr class="bundle-duo__divider">
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if key_ingredients %}
        <div class="bundle-duo__accordion" data-accordion>
          <button
            type="button"
            id="accordion-ingredients-trigger-{{ section.id }}"
            class="bundle-duo__accordion-trigger"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="accordion-ingredients-{{ section.id }}">
            <span>{{ 'sections.product_bundle.key_ingredients' | t }}</span>
            <svg class="bundle-duo__accordion-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              <path d="M1 8H15M8 1V15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <div
            class="bundle-duo__accordion-content"
            id="accordion-ingredients-{{ section.id }}"
            role="region"
            aria-labelledby="accordion-ingredients-trigger-{{ section.id }}"
            aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="bundle-duo__accordion-body">
              {{ product.metafields.custom.key_ingredients | metafield_tag }}
              {% if full_ingredient_list %}
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="bundle-duo__ingredients-link"
                  data-open-ingredients
                  aria-haspopup="dialog">
                  {{ 'sections.product_bundle.all_ingredients' | t }}
                </button>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
          <hr class="bundle-duo__divider">
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} Trust Badges {%- endcomment -%}
    {% if section.blocks.size > 0 %}
      <div class="bundle-duo__badges">
        {% for block in section.blocks %}
          {% if block.type == 'trust_badge' %}
            <div class="bundle-duo__badge" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              {% if block.settings.icon %}
                <span
                  class="bundle-duo__badge-icon"
                  role="img"
                  aria-label="{{ block.settings.label | default: '' }}"
                  style="-webkit-mask-image: url('{{ block.settings.icon | image_url: width: 60 }}'); mask-image: url('{{ block.settings.icon | image_url: width: 60 }}');">
                </span>
              {% endif %}
              {% if block.settings.label %}
                <p class="bundle-duo__badge-label">{{ block.settings.label }}</p>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Ingredients Popup {%- endcomment -%}
  {% if full_ingredient_list %}
    <dialog
      class="bundle-duo__dialog"
      id="ingredients-dialog-{{ section.id }}"
      scroll-lock
      aria-labelledby="dialog-title-{{ section.id }}">
      <div class="bundle-duo__dialog-inner">
        <div class="bundle-duo__dialog-header">
          <h2 id="dialog-title-{{ section.id }}" class="bundle-duo__dialog-title">{{ 'sections.product_bundle.ingredients_popup_title' | t }}</h2>
          <button
            type="button"
            class="bundle-duo__dialog-close"
            data-close-ingredients
            aria-label="{{ 'sections.product_bundle.close' | t }}">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              <path d="M2 2L18 18M18 2L2 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="bundle-duo__dialog-body">
          {{ product.metafields.custom.full_ingredient_list | metafield_tag }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </dialog>
  {% endif %}

  {%- comment -%} Product data JSON for JS {%- endcomment -%}
  {% if scent_collection %}
    <script type="application/json" data-duo-products>
      {
        "bundleVariantId": {{ current_variant.id | json }},
        "scentPropertyName": {{ scent_property_name | json }},
        "companionPropertyName": {{ companion_property_name | json }},
        "companionPropertyValue": {{ companion_property_value | json }},
        "scents": {
          {%- assign scent_comma = '' -%}
          {% for scent_product in scent_collection.products %}
            {%- assign scent_coming_soon = false -%}
            {%- if scent_product.tags contains 'coming-soon' or scent_product.tags contains 'Coming soon' or scent_product.tags contains 'coming soon' or scent_product.tags contains 'Coming Soon' -%}
              {%- assign scent_coming_soon = true -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {% if scent_product.metafields.custom.scent_name != blank and scent_product.available and scent_coming_soon == false %}
              {{ scent_comma }}
              "{{ scent_product.handle }}": {
                "title": {{ scent_product.title | json }},
                "variantId": {{ scent_product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id | json }},
                "variantGid": {{ scent_product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id | prepend: 'gid://shopify/ProductVariant/' | json }},
                {%- if scent_product.metafields.custom.card_image != blank -%}
                  "cardImage": {{ scent_product.metafields.custom.card_image | image_url: width: 800 | json }},
                {%- elsif scent_product.featured_image -%}
                  "cardImage": {{ scent_product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 | json }},
                {%- else -%}
                  "cardImage": "",
                {%- endif -%}
                "price": {{ scent_product.price | json }},
                "available": {{ scent_product.available | json }},
                "variantAvailable": {{ scent_product.selected_or_first_available_variant.available | json }}
              }
              {%- assign scent_comma = ',' -%}
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        }
      }
    </script>
  {% endif %}
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
  /* ============================================
     Base styles (Mobile-first, matching product.liquid)
     ============================================ */

  .bundle-duo {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--gradient-1) 1.4%, var(--gradient-2) 55%);
    margin-top: var(--total-header-height, 110px);
    color: var(--product-text, #3E2027);
  }

  /* --- Mobile Header (above image on mobile) --- */

  .bundle-duo__mobile-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 50px 12px 0;
  }

  .bundle-duo__mobile-subtitle-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  /* --- Desktop-only header (hidden on mobile) --- */

  .bundle-duo__desktop-header {
    display: none;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  /* --- Image Column --- */

  .bundle-duo__image-column {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 20px 12px 30px;
  }

  .bundle-duo__bottles {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 416px;
    min-height: 340px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Two slots, not three: the bundle's heavy -30px overlap is meant to fan out
     a row of identical bottles. A tall bottle beside a flat wipes pouch needs
     them separated, not stacked — just enough negative margin to absorb the
     transparent padding around each image. */
  .bundle-duo__bottle-slot {
    flex: 1;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 -12px;
  }

  .bundle-duo__bottle-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 340px;
    object-fit: contain;
    transition: opacity 0.4s ease;
  }

  /* The wipes pouch is wider and shorter than a bottle; cap it so the bottle
     still reads as the hero of the pair. */
  .bundle-duo__companion-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 260px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .bundle-duo__bottle-placeholder {
    width: 45%;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    border: 2px dashed var(--product-text, #3E2027);
    border-radius: 40% 40% 10% 10%;
    opacity: 0.15;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .bundle-duo__bottle-number {
    font-family: var(--font-alyona);
    font-size: 32px;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  /* --- Info Column --- */

  .bundle-duo__info-column {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 30px;
    padding: 0 12px 40px;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* --- Rating --- */

  .bundle-duo__rating {
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--product-text);
  }

  .bundle-duo__rating .star-rating__layer {
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .bundle-duo__rating .star-rating__layer svg {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
  }

  .bundle-duo__rating .star-rating__count {
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  /* --- Header Typography --- */

  .bundle-duo__subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-sweet-sans);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: normal;
    letter-spacing: -0.16px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--product-text, #3E2027);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .bundle-duo__title {
    font-family: var(--font-alyona);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 34px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--product-text, #3E2027);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .bundle-duo__size,
  .bundle-duo__size-line {
    font-family: var(--font-sweet-sans);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: normal;
    letter-spacing: -0.13px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--product-text, #3E2027);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* --- Scent Selectors --- */

  .bundle-duo__selectors {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .bundle-duo__selector {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .bundle-duo__selector-trigger {
    width: 100%;
    height: 40px;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-family: var(--font-sweet-sans);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: -0.14px;
    color: var(--product-text, #3E2027);
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--product-text, #3E2027);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .bundle-duo__selector.is-selected .bundle-duo__selector-trigger {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    border-color: transparent;
  }

  .bundle-duo__selector-chevron {
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .bundle-duo__selector-trigger[aria-expanded="true"] .bundle-duo__selector-chevron {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .bundle-duo__selector-list {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    top: 100%;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--product-text, #3E2027);
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    z-index: 10;
    max-height: none;
    overflow-y: visible;
  }

  .bundle-duo__selector-trigger[aria-expanded="true"] + .bundle-duo__selector-list {
    display: block;
  }

  .bundle-duo__selector-option {
    padding: 10px 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-sweet-sans);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: -0.14px;
    color: var(--product-text, #3E2027);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .bundle-duo__selector-option:hover {
    background-color: var(--gradient-1);
  }

  .bundle-duo__selector-option[aria-disabled="true"] {
    opacity: 0.35;
    text-decoration: line-through;
    cursor: not-allowed;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .bundle-duo__selector-option[aria-selected="true"] {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* --- Divider --- */

  .bundle-duo__divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--product-text, #3E2027);
    opacity: 0.2;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* --- Purchase Row --- */

  .bundle-duo__purchase-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .bundle-duo__price {
    font-family: var(--font-sweet-sans);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 26px;
    line-height: normal;
    letter-spacing: -0.26px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--product-text, #3E2027);
    margin: 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .bundle-duo__actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    width: 100%;
